0 G-02 LEGAL: a clip closed around the EDGE of a tile.
0 The tile is held in the curved jaw of the U-clip, gripping its edge the way
0 the clip would grip a bar -- not resting on top of it. Current clip mouldings
0 hold this reliably; older ones did not, which is why it is often listed as
0 forbidden.
